Package: MigraineEmaxSim
Type: Package
Title: Bayesian Emax Modeling and Migraine Development Program Simulation
Version: 0.3.1
Authors@R: person(given = "Clinical", family = "Modeling", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "clinical.modeling@example.com")
Description: Utilities for fitting constrained Bayesian historical meta-analytic priors, fitting an ED50 Emax model to the HOPE trial, and simulating two migraine development programs. The historical meta-analysis ignores numerical historical dose values because they are from different drugs. The included CSV is provided in data/ and inst/extdata/. Baseline MMD means and SDs are included as a baseline likelihood in both the historical meta-analysis and the HOPE Emax model.
